WEBVTT

00:07:29.797 --> 00:07:31.863
to immunize children.

00:07:31.897 --> 00:07:34.097
Today, I think it has pivoted

00:07:34.130 --> 00:07:38.097
and it has gotten recognised as a major
vaccine producer in the world.

00:07:38.097 --> 00:07:41.163
So I think it's important
for us to recognize

00:07:41.197 --> 00:07:46.730
that India is a very critical part
of the global supply chain

00:07:46.763 --> 00:07:48.230
when it comes to vaccines

00:07:48.263 --> 00:07:50.497
and even generic medicines,
for that matter.

00:07:51.063 --> 00:07:54.397
SR: Many countries in the developing world
have actually done very well

00:07:54.430 --> 00:07:57.330
in controlling the virus,
in controlling COVID-19,

00:07:57.363 --> 00:08:00.430
and has gotten somewhat better
than other parts of the world.